And I think the answer that most people are familiar with who, who think about these things

00:37:37.777 --> 00:37:43.376
is do we have prior information? How do we use that prior information? And do we want, do we

00:37:43.376 --> 00:37:49.457
want to be opinionated about incorporating that through a specific or rigorous prior distribution

00:37:50.256 --> 00:37:56.096
on the parameters? And do we want to have, you know, other techniques that may go beyond

