00:39:15.617 --> 00:39:22.016
large phase three study with potentially thousands of patients. And so, and it turns out that not

00:39:22.016 --> 00:39:28.497
only do you not have to have a specific parameter in that model for, for the way that you're

00:39:28.497 --> 00:39:34.976
quantifying the treatment effect, you, you don't need frequentist asymptotics, like, like asymptotic

00:39:34.976 --> 00:39:39.216
approximations, like the Delta method to get at the information that you're trying to look for.

00:39:39.216 --> 00:39:47.856
